nce the required information has been gathered as far as reasonably possible.\nThis is a time-critical dialogue. Minimize the number of questions asked while ensuring safety and completeness.\nUse the provided schema to understand which fields belong to personalia and which correspond to RD1 and RD2.\nContinue asking targeted questions only as needed to determine and fill RD1-related variables.\nOnly AFTER RD1 is true are you allowed to ask for more details in a single generic and open question.\nDo not mention RD2 or any RD2 symptom names directly in this question.\nDo not ask any additional new questions specifically targeting RD2 symptoms after this generic question.", "timestamp": "2025-12-24T10:48:52.010638Z", "dynamic_ref": null, "part_kind": "system-prompt"}, {"content": "", "timestamp": "2025-12-24T10:48:52.010646Z", "part_kind": "user-prompt"}], "instructions": "Only use the following language: english.", "kind": "request", "run_id": "328fb700-a6e1-4152-8053-52aa2aced45f", "metadata": null}, {"parts": [{"tool_name": "final_result", "args": {"next_question": "Hello, thank you for calling the emergency services. My name is [Agent Name]. What is your name?"}, "tool_call_id": "pyd_ai_44f174b8db9e4f45a71f8108bc00a7c2", "id": null, "provider_details": {"thought_signature": "CsMBAXLI2nxEcbcO7UVoF3dVV3XV/pgGiR/eKuSX2aDPn5x7uSR1WfI5Eu2q/epXiOtM7HhH9XassNt1wDJEne/DRcgsJAB9c+FCoEVqgfshaBpsy+eYHg7bV6y1SBO93rdfdDVhxCQ8bOi9ttJWZFiUvPp+V9p4xt1Er5Cae7h9fWThoU+sXIt/O7wpayh/IX4kGEEDZHMsqktYpBAfKB87BmjZGPwz++2BhtqNPqzB48O2gm4XjgOrjm/XOLFe1/EUO1VL"}, "part_kind": "tool-call"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 2437, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "cache_read_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 72, "input_audio_tokens": 0, "cache_audio_read_tokens": 0, "output_audio_tokens": 0, "details": {"thoughts_tokens": 34, "text_prompt_tokens": 2437}}, "model_name": "gemini-2.5-flash", "timestamp": "2025-12-24T10:48:53.048997Z", "kind": "response", "provider_name": "google-gla", "provider_url": "https://gene